        </div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <div>
            <em>2021 - Present</em>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">React</span>
            <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag">Fastify</span>
            <span class="tag">GraphQL</span>
            <span class="tag">react-hook-form</span>
            <span class="tag">React-DnD</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text">
        <p>
          This project is started as a way to learn something new that could
          help me on my full-time job, but now it is something very important to
          me.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most of the components (some of which are quite complex) used in this
          project are built by me. For example, the full calendar component uses
          the drag-and-drop technique extensively, and I've spent a lot of time
          making it work correctly. The calendar is also scrollable in each
          direction infinitely, which is not very common for such kinds of
          applications.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <div>
        <div class="project-title">
          <img
            src="/images/editor.png"
            alt="Kona logo"
            width="38"
            height="34"
          />
          <a
            class="project-link"
            href="http://use-kona.github.io/editor/"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <h3>Kona Editor</h3>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <div>
            <em>2025 - Present</em>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">React</span>
            <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag">Slate.js</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text">
        <p>
          I absolutely adore text editors! Text editor was the first project
          that I started building ~20 years ago to learn programming.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've chosen Slate framework for building this project. It's a powerful
          and very complex library, but I've been able to learn a lot from it.
          All the plugins for Kona Editor are built by me.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
  <section class="text-center">
    <p>I'm sure together we can make Linear even better!</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:edencore@gmail.com">Contact me</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
